<item><title>Sudan and Ethiopia trade accusations over armed groups</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/sudan-and-ethiopia-trade-accusations-over-armed-groups-36ac7b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/sudan-and-ethiopia-trade-accusations-over-armed-groups-36ac7b/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>Sudan&apos;s military and Ethiopia each accuse the other of harbouring armed groups that fight inside their borders, and each denies the charges.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:40:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" length="32890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
